0 FILE 10183 - 10 - Passenger car.ldr
0 Red passenger coach with glazed side walls of alternating clear window panels and grille vents, red brick walls with handle/headlight bricks and white plate trim, black curved end caps and patterned letter/seal tiles, two buffer end platforms, mounted on two magnetic single-axle wheel bogies (with padding, roof and wheels submodels)
